{"doc_id":"krill-integration-overview-2026-09-01","title":"Krill API 接入方式概览","content":"Krill 官网说明其服务通过替换 API Base URL 和鉴权信息接入现有客户端与工具链，并提供面向 OpenAI、Claude 等模型的统一路由。具体端点和凭据必须从登录后的当前教程获取，本快照不保存端点或密钥。","authority":"official_public_website","source_url":"https://www.krill-ai.net/","retrieved_at":"2026-09-01","review_after":"2026-10-01","volatility":"medium","products":["codex","claude","openai_gpt"],"categories":["configuration_integration"],"keywords":["base url","api","接入","配置","鉴权","endpoint","openai","claude"],"claims":[{"claim_id":"integration-base-url-auth","statement":"接入通常需要配置 Krill 提供的 Base URL 和鉴权信息。","contradiction_patterns":["无需.{0,12}(?:base ?url|api地址|鉴权|密钥)","不能.{0,12}(?:配置|更换).{0,12}(?:base ?url|api地址)"]}]}
